Hi Lain,

The vignette provides two ways of getting a map. I think you are using the first way but want the second way: using predict() with a raster stack as the newdata. See the first line of code on page 4 of the spatial vignette PDF. This returns a RasterStack with 4 rasters, one each for predicted, SE, 95% lower and 95% upper.

Ken

